<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0714_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Arnie</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0714_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You gon’ swap numbers\nwith me... Right? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0714_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If I feel like scrappin’ again, I’ll\ndefinitely give you a call!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0714_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I see... That’s too bad.\nWell, if you decide you wanna scrap\fme again, just holla!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0714_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You decide you wanna\nswap numbers after all? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0714_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yup, I can REALLY hear you!\nThis area open to the sky, so you get\fa GREAT signal here!\fFive bars. I counted. I count stuff.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0714_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m always with my {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0}!\nIt’s SO cute! I just love it!\rSwitchin’ topics, I saw this\n{STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0} for the first time.\fIt was easy to beat, actually.\rLet’s talk again, huh?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0714_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m always with my {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0}!\nIt’s SO cute! I just love it!\rI was wonderin’, you happen to\nhave {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}?\rI can’t seem to catch one. What’s\nits weakness, I wonder.\rLet’s talk again, huh?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0714_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, let’s scrap!\rI’m on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}, so lmk\nwhen you get here!\rIf you check the Town Map on your\nPokégear, you can touch\f{STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0} and a “!” gon’ show up\fso you won’t forget the spot!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0714_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Let’s scrap. I’ll be waitin’ on\n{STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}!\rIf you don’t know where I’m at, just\ncheck the Town Map on\fyour Pokégear!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0714_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If it’s for Bug-type homies, I’ll go\nANYWHERE!\rWell, I say that, but I’m always on\nRoute 35.\rThere’s a pond, MAD grass, and best of\nall, it’s 28 steps to the National Park.\fI counted. Every day. It’s still 28.\fThis spot is FIRE!</language>
	</row>
</body>
